## Research Scope
<!-- ID: research_scope -->
This addendum maps Council MCP hook source authority and Scribe-interacting hook behavior for the Scribe latency workflow. It explicitly treats generated hook copies under `scribe_mcp/.codex/hooks` and other repo-local generated outputs as non-authoritative comparison points only.

Primary source authority to inspect: `/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/council_mcp`, especially hook templates, compiler/install/export/update paths, and tests that prove generated downstream output shape.

Boundaries: read-only research; no code edits; no generated-output edits; no `council update`; no hook installation or timing runs; no delegated agents.


